| Z1 USB 注意 | Z1 接电脑 USB 会干扰 boot(进重启循环)——**刷写才插 USB,正常开机拔掉**。MTK preloader 看 USB LineState 判模式 |
| 交叉编译器 | `/usr/bin/arm-linux-gnueabihf-gcc` (外编 wlan/wmt 用) |
| 主线 mainline 源树 | `/home/lxj/claude/6572/fork_linux` (Linux 7.0-rc7 + mt6572-mainline fork 驱动已合并) |
| 当前 boot 产物 | `out/boot_mainline_z1_stable.img` (5.8MB, Alpine switch_root, console=ttyS0@115200) |
| Alpine rootfs | `out/system_alpine.img` (40MB ext4, Alpine 3.24 armv7, 含 adbd + CONNSYS .ko) |

## 2. 编译命令

### 2a. mainline Z1 boot.img (已编通)
```
cd /home/lxj/claude/6572/fork_linux
make ARCH=arm CROSS_COMPILE=arm-linux-gnueabihf- mt6572-z1.dtb zImage   # 产物 arch/arm/boot/zImage + dts/mediatek/mt6572-z1.dtb
# 然后打包成 boot.img (ANDROD!! magic, 见 BUILD_Z1_REPORT.md 字段表)
```
.config 须含: CONFIG_ARM=y CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK=y CONFIG_MACH_MT6572=y

### 2b. WiFi wlan.ko 外编 (当前卡点,见 §4)
```
cd /home/lxj/claude/6572/fork_linux
make ARCH=arm CROSS_COMPILE=arm-linux-gnueabihf- M=drivers/misc/mediatek/connectivity/drv_wlan/mt6620/wlan modules
```
- 外编 M= **不读根 .config autoconf.h**, 源码里 `#if CONFIG_XXX` 撞 #error / undeclared 时, 要在该 wlan/Makefile 里 `ccflags-y += -DCONFIG_XXX=1` 手动喂。
- 已喂: `-DCONFIG_NL80211_TESTMODE=1`, `-isystem $(gcc -print-file-name=include)` (解决 stddef.h fatal)
- **待加(已确认根因): `-DCONFIG_WIRELESS_EXT=1`** — mainline netdevice.h 把 `ieee80211_ptr` 成员包在 `#ifdef CONFIG_WIRELESS_EXT` 里, 外编没喂 → gl_init.c:2165/2938/2941 报 "no member"。加此 flag 消三错。

